  "description": "Operating Area: Greece\n\nHOW MUCH IS ENOUGH is a striking Benetti Oasis 40, designed for a charter experience that combines contemporary luxury with relaxed outdoor living. Withher elegant profile, refined interiors, and seamless connection to the sea, she is ideal for guests seeking comfort, style, and effortless enjoyment on board.\nShe accommodates up to 10 guests in beautifully appointed cabins, each offering privacy, comfort, and a calm, modern atmosphere. The full-beam master suite is a standout, featuring a private balcony with panoramic ocean views and a luxurious his-and-hers bathroom. Throughout the yacht, the sophisticated interior design by Bonetti/Kozerski Architecture creates a refined yet welcoming ambiance.\n\nThe main deck salon is another highlight, with panoramic sliding glass doors to port, starboard, and aft, allowing a seamless flow between the interior and exterior spaces while filling the yacht with natural light and uninterrupted sea views. \n\nOne of HOW MUCH IS ENOUGH’s defining features is her exceptional outdoorliving. Generous deck areas offer plenty of space for sunbathing, lounging, and alfresco dining, while the beach club, complete with an infinity pool and fold-down side wings, creates a uniquely open and relaxed atmosphere by the water. Guests\ncan also enjoy an outdoor cinema under the stars, a sundeck dining area for up to 12 guests with a large TV screen, and a fully equipped main-deck gym with Technogym equipment and a yoga setup.\n\nIn addition, HOW MUCH IS ENOUGH stands out for her very low fuel consumption and sustainability-focused features, including a water filtration system for drinking water.\n\nWith her sophisticated layout and standout indoor-outdoor design, HOW MUCH IS ENOUGH delivers a charter experience defined by elegance, comfort, and the unmistakable appeal of the Benetti Oasis 40.\n",
